# The spec, its threads AND its runs are committed here: this repository's
# ledger is the point of the repository, and a run record is 3KB of JSON
# somebody reviews. That is the spec standard with one line fewer - the
# `blueprints/*/runs/` rule `walkdown init --commit spec` would write is
# deliberately absent. Evidence is 97MB of screenshots nobody reads in a
# diff, and a draft is one person's half-finished sitting.
blueprints/*/evidence/
blueprints/*/drafts/
